{"id":"5541835907abfd54","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-transition-probability.md","title":"Transition Probability","display":"df-transition-probability — Transition Probability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-transition-probability","aliases":["58-df-transition-probability"],"display":"df-transition-probability — Transition Probability","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-transition-probability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-transition-probability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-transition-probability — Transition Probability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,\\mathcal E,P,J,\\mathcal B([0,1])\\in V\">\\(E,\\mathcal E,P,J,\\mathcal B([0,1])\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitionProbability}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitionProbability}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(t,x,\\cdot)\">\\(P(t,x,\\cdot)\\)</span> 表示函数图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle A,P(t,x,A)\\rangle:A\\in\\mathcal E\\}\">\\(\\{\\langle A,P(t,x,A)\\rangle:A\\in\\mathcal E\\}\\)</span>，积分采用依赖文件中的非负 Lebesgue 积分；三参数形式是下式给出的存在投影。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transition\\text{-}probability}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TransitionProbability}_S(P,E,\\mathcal E,J)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(P,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\times E\\times\\mathcal E,[0,1])\n\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in E\\;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S(P(t,x,\\cdot),E,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal E\\;\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(P(t,\\cdot,A);(E,\\mathcal E),([0,1],\\mathcal B([0,1])))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(J,\\{P\\}\\times\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^2\\times E\\times\\mathcal E,[0,1])\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in E\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal E\\;\n\\left(P(s+t,x,A)=J(\\langle P,s,t,x,A\\rangle)\n=\\int_E P(t,y,A)\\,P(s,x,dy)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transition\\text{-}probability}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TransitionProbability}_S(P,E,\\mathcal E,J)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(P,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\times E\\times\\mathcal E,[0,1])\n\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in E\\;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S(P(t,x,\\cdot),E,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal E\\;\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(P(t,\\cdot,A);(E,\\mathcal E),([0,1],\\mathcal B([0,1])))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(J,\\{P\\}\\times\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^2\\times E\\times\\mathcal E,[0,1])\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in E\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal E\\;\n\\left(P(s+t,x,A)=J(\\langle P,s,t,x,A\\rangle)\n=\\int_E P(t,y,A)\\,P(s,x,dy)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitionProbability}_S(P,E,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists J\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TransitionProbability}_S(P,E,\\mathcal E,J).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TransitionProbability}_S(P,E,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists J\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TransitionProbability}_S(P,E,\\mathcal E,J).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 不再是任意函数：定义式将每个取值绑定到核积分。三参数形式只隐藏这一由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 唯一确定的积分表。</li>\n<li>Transition probabilities determine the law of a Markov process.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]) and $\\mathrm{Measurable}_S$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]) and $\\mathrm{Measurable}_S$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,\\mathcal E,P,J,\\mathcal B([0,1])\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitionProbability}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"P(t,x,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\langle A,P(t,x,A)\\rangle:A\\in\\mathcal E\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transition\\text{-}probability}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{TransitionProbability}_S(P,E,\\mathcal E,J)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Function}(P,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\times E\\times\\mathcal E,[0,1])\n\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in E\\;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S(P(t,x,\\cdot),E,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal E\\;\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(P(t,\\cdot,A);(E,\\mathcal E),([0,1],\\mathcal B([0,1])))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(J,\\{P\\}\\times\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^2\\times E\\times\\mathcal E,[0,1])\\\\\n&\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in E\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal E\\;\n\\left(P(s+t,x,A)=J(\\langle P,s,t,x,A\\rangle)\n=\\int_E P(t,y,A)\\,P(s,x,dy)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitionProbability}_S(P,E,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists J\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TransitionProbability}_S(P,E,\\mathcal E,J).","display":true},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false}],"bytes":2040,"backlinks":[{"id":"ef103f0303462b75","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TransitionProbability}_S(P,E,\\mathcal E)$ (transition-probability predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-transition-probability.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1315","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-transition-probability.md|58-df-transition-probability]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["0578a357a86e9d8f","bbbec05fde1d3b01","36d7463d215be751","4884f45058a56aac"]}